                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Over the weekend, The Baltimore Sun published my op-ed on Maryland\u2019s legal victories and the work of our Federal Accountability Unit.\n\nSome critics question whether this team\u2019s work is worth it, but the FAU has recovered hundreds of millions in federal funding for schools, health care, and community programs \u2014 far more than the resources it uses. Their work protects tax dollars, keeps essential programs running, and upholds the rule of law.\n\nMaryland doesn\u2019t have to choose between defending constitutional rights and securing federal funding; we can do both while responsibly managing state resources.\n\n\ud83d\udd17 Read the full op-ed here: https://t.co/lQ0hRiAniK",
