                "text": "September is National Suicide Prevention Month\u2014a time to raise awareness, break stigma, and connect people to help.\n\nYoung people in Maryland and across the country are facing a serious mental health crisis, with suicide rates continuing to rise. Everyone deserves support, understanding, and access to care \u2014and I\u2019m committed to making sure that access is there for you. You are not alone.\n\n#SuicidePreventionMonth",
