                "text": "I joined 22 attorneys general to oppose the Trump administration\u2019s plan to deprive veterans and their families of abortion care and counseling, even in cases of rape, incest, or serious health risks.  Veterans deserve the same standard of care as anyone else, including counseling and lifesaving services when their health or safety is at risk.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/nWeaVsKDyQ",
