                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I joined 23 attorneys general, counties, and cities to oppose the Trump administration\u2019s plan to erase the Environmental Protection Agency\u2019s 2009 Endangerment Finding.\n\nThat finding confirmed greenhouse gases cause climate change and threaten public health. Rolling it back would gut clean air protections and weaken vehicle pollution standards. We\u2019re fighting to protect Marylanders\u2019 health and our environment.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/BRJOl6bLBz",
