                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined 16 attorneys general and D.C. in suing to block a new federal policy that threatens $950,000 for Maryland\u2019s sexual health education programs. These programs give teens the tools to prevent pregnancy, stop the spread of STIs, and make healthy choices \u2014 and they must remain inclusive and evidence-based for every student.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/nLviTCDQ7G",
