                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Victory: The Department of Justice has dropped its unlawful plan to block nearly $1.4 billion in federal funds for crime victims. That includes more than $23 million in Maryland for services like emergency shelter, medical care, and counseling for survivors.\n\nWe took action, and now these critical Victims of Crime Act grants will keep flowing to support survivors without being tied to political agendas.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/4AiebTv8u0",
