                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The U.S. Department of Justice is demanding access to private medical records from Boston Children\u2019s Hospital related to gender-affirming care \u2014 a dangerous overreach that violates privacy and targets transgender youth.\n\nI joined 19 attorneys general opposing this unlawful effort. No government should single out young people or their doctors for providing medically necessary, evidence-based care.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/HSYoGk1uO7",
