                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A federal judge has blocked the administration from discontinuing funding for K\u201312 mental health programs after our multistate lawsuit challenged the move as unlawful.\n\nThis ruling protects programs at Bowie State University\u00a0and the University of Maryland, Baltimore,\u00a0which train school counselors and provide essential support to students across Maryland. We\u2019ll keep fighting to secure the resources that help\u00a0our children learn and thrive.\n\nFull press release:\u00a0https://t.co/RPmN2MLmDB",
