                "text": "A federal judge has blocked the administration from cutting funding for teen sexual health education programs that affirm all young people\u2019s gender identities.\u00a0\n\nThis ruling protects programs that serve more than 1,400 Maryland youth every year, including in communities like Prince George\u2019s County, where access to sexual health resources saves lives. My Office will keep fighting to ensure every young person has the education and support they deserve to stay safe and healthy.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/QdVvWmgxkZ",
