                "text": "In 2018, I suffered a stroke\u2014an experience that forever changed my perspective on health. I was fortunate, but too many aren\u2019t. Early detection, regular check-ups, and healthy habits save lives. Your future begins with the choices you make for your health right now. #StrokeAwarenessMonth",
