                "text": "Withholding SNAP benefits hurts Maryland\u2019s most vulnerable \u2014 families skipping meals, seniors choosing between food and medicine, and food banks stretched thin.\n \nThe federal government has the funds to pay full benefits but is choosing not to. I joined 26 attorneys general urging the court not to disturb the lower court\u2019s order requiring full SNAP payments so families don\u2019t go hungry because of politics.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/1aG64Gom4A",
