                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I spoke out against proposed Trump administration rules that would further restrict access to medically necessary gender-affirming care.\n\nThese proposals would block federal health coverage, penalize providers, and weaken disability protections\u2014putting politics over patients. Maryland law protects access to this care, and my Office will continue to stand up for the health, dignity, and rights of all Marylanders.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/9wGCIXPYAG",
