                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined a coalition of 20 attorneys general in opposing a proposed federal rule that would scare immigrant families away from getting food, health care, or housing assistance they are legally allowed to use.\n\nMy Office is standing up for immigrant families and working to make sure people don\u2019t lose access to basic services they need to stay healthy and safe.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/RtLMZQwcfe",
