                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A federal judge ordered the U.S. Department of Education to reverse its unlawful decision to cancel school mental health grants.\n\nThese grants fund counselors, psychologists, and other mental health professionals in K-12 schools\u2014support students\u2019 safety and well-being. After we sued, the court made clear the department cannot cancel funding on the basis of arbitrary and unexplained decision making.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/1ttHp8NcXE",
