                "text": "Today, I joined other attorneys general in supporting a lawsuit challenging an unlawful $100,000 fee on H-1B visas that would make it harder for hospitals, schools, and universities to hire needed workers.\n\u00a0\nThis policy would worsen labor shortages in health care, education, and research. My Office is standing up to protect our workforce and ensure people can access essential services.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/t2vRG0lcXG",
